{
  "_snapshot": "PROPOSED — not yet created in n8n. Intake for the booking-recovery system. POST /webhook/booking-recovery-capture receives lead snapshots from IClosedCapture.astro on synchrosocial.com and upserts them into the n8n Data Table `booking_recovery`, keyed by a normalised lead key. stage=started arms a follow-up (status=pending, follow_up_due_at = now + 30 min). stage=booked or stage=disqualified suppresses it. The scheduled dispatcher (02-booking-recovery-dispatch.json) does the sending. BEFORE IMPORT: create the Data Table `booking_recovery` with the columns listed in docs/booking-recovery/README.md, then replace every REPLACE_WITH_DATA_TABLE_ID below with its id. Set the workflow's Error Workflow to 'SyncView — Error Alerts → DM Sidney' per house convention.",
  "name": "Sales — Booking Recovery Capture",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "errorWorkflow": "REPLACE_WITH_ERROR_WORKFLOW_ID"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Receive POST": { "main": [[{ "node": "Normalize Lead", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Normalize Lead": { "main": [[{ "node": "Started?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Started?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Arm Follow-up", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Suppress Follow-up", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
